<%= stylesheet_link_tag "lightek_marketplace", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %><div id="lm-marketplace"><div class="lm-main"><%= link_to "← Products & services", main_app.dashboard_marketplace_path, class: "lm-textbutton" %><div class="lm-title-row"><div><h1>Application connections</h1><p>Connect an application once, then offer access through your products.</p></div><%= link_to "+ Connect an application", main_app.new_dashboard_marketplace_connection_path, class: "lm-action" %></div><p class="lm-note">A connection describes what customers can use and where they open it. Internal capabilities are not imported as sellable services.</p><% if notice %><p role="status"><%= notice %></p><% end %><div class="lm-products"><% @connections.each do |connection| %><section class="lm-product"><div class="lm-productbody"><span class="lm-tag"><%= connection.active? ? "Reviewed · ready for products" : "Draft connection" %></span><h2><%= connection.name %></h2><p><%= connection.description %></p><p class="lm-small">Customer opens: <%= connection.customer_path %></p><%= link_to "Edit connection ↗", main_app.edit_dashboard_marketplace_connection_path(connection), class: "lm-action secondary" %></div></section><% end %><% if @connections.empty? %><div class="lm-empty"><h2>No applications connected yet.</h2><p>Website delivery and team-delivered work are already available. Connect an application here when its customer access is ready.</p></div><% end %></div></div></div>
